window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Some men keep secrets. Others keep them on ice.</p> <p>Jessa Vale survives on instinct, lipstick, and the blade strapped to her thigh. A truck stop drifter with nowhere left to run, she knows better than to accept rides from quiet men in black rigs. But when a winter storm traps her in Ohio, one driver makes an offer she can’t refuse.</p> <p>He’s gentle—almost. Attentive—too much. And the cab of his truck is colder than it should be.</p> <p>What begins as a ride west becomes something far darker. As snow falls and CB static rises, Jessa is drawn into a world of frostbitten memories, frozen desire, and a man who may love her—or collect her.</p> <p><i>Unfrost</i> is a dark, erotic psychological romance about obsession, isolation, and the voices that whisper just beneath the ice.</p>"; 
